  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "生態環境保育",
    "sub_ename": "ECOLOGY AND EVIRONMENT PROTECTION",
    "describe_ch": "近年來，人類為尋求與大自然和平共處方法，生態環境保育已蔚為世界潮流。藉由本課程對生態與環境互動關係之介紹，以期對台灣生態環境演變及所面臨問題有初步認識與瞭解，且珍惜周遭自然環境。",
    "describe_eh": "For the past few years, humans have been trying to find optimum methods to live in peace with the ecological environment. Ecological environmental protection is a current trend in the world. This course introduces the interactive relationship between ecology and environment to let learners understand the changes and problems regarding the ecological environment in Taiwan in order to more treasure our environment.",
